# 6. Wire Check Routes into the Go Server

Update `server/cmd/sentrix-server/main.go`.

Add import:

```go
"github.com/sentrix/server/internal/checks"
```

Inside the authenticated user group, add:

```go
r.Get("/checks", checks.HandleListChecks(pool))
```

Inside the `ADMIN + OPERATOR` group, add:

```go
r.Post("/checks", checks.HandleCreateCheck(pool))
r.Patch("/checks/{checkID}", checks.HandleUpdateCheck(pool))
r.Delete("/checks/{checkID}", checks.HandleDeleteCheck(pool))
```

Inside the agent-authenticated group, after telemetry, add:

```go
r.Get("/agent/checks", checks.HandleAgentChecks(pool))
r.Post("/agent/check-results", checks.HandleAgentCheckResults(pool))
```

Your agent group should now look like:

```go
r.Group(func(r chi.Router) {
	r.Use(metrics.AgentAuthMiddleware(pool))
	r.Post("/agent/telemetry", metrics.HandleTelemetry(pool))
	r.Get("/agent/checks", checks.HandleAgentChecks(pool))
	r.Post("/agent/check-results", checks.HandleAgentCheckResults(pool))
})
```

