### Step 2: The C Linux Agent (Task 7)

Now we write the actual systems-level code. We will read directly from the Linux `/proc` filesystem. To keep dependencies at zero (no `libcurl`, no `cJSON`), we will write a custom JSON builder and a raw POSIX socket HTTP client.

