# 16. Production Notes

For production, set:

```bash
WEB_ORIGIN="https://monitor.example.com"
```

Then the WebSocket handler will validate the origin instead of allowing all origins.

Also:

```txt
Use HTTPS
Use WSS
Put SentriX behind a reverse proxy that supports WebSocket upgrades
Do not put JWT tokens in WebSocket URLs
Use the one-time ticket flow implemented above
```

Example reverse proxy upgrade requirements:

```txt
HTTP/1.1 Upgrade
Connection: Upgrade
Sec-WebSocket-Key
Sec-WebSocket-Version
Sec-WebSocket-Protocol
```

Most production proxies support this, but WebSocket upgrade support must be explicitly enabled.

